      "text": "Line chart “DA. 3.3 – Outpatient department visits by age group and sex”, 2015–2019, with four series: female 0–4 years, male 0–4 years, female 5+ years and male 5+ years. Females aged 5+ have the most visits (about 55 000, declining slightly), followed by males 5+ (under 40 000); both 0–4 year groups stay between about 20 000 and 25 000.",
